Third-party software
--------------------

This product depends on and links the following third-party software:

  go.opentelemetry.io/ebpf-profiler
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

    This module embeds compiled eBPF programs (its support/ebpf/* sources)
    whose license is the GNU General Public License, version 2 (GPL-2.0):
    the Linux kernel requires eBPF programs that use certain helpers to
    declare a GPL-compatible license. The compiled bytecode is shipped
    inside the module via go:embed and is loaded into the kernel at runtime;
    it is not copied into this repository. A build of runtime-agent that
    enables the `ebpf` profile therefore constitutes a combined work that
    includes GPL-2.0-licensed eBPF bytecode. Builds without the `ebpf`
    profile do not load or distribute that bytecode.

    See the dependency's own LICENSE and LICENSES/ for the full terms of its
    Apache-2.0 code and its GPL-2.0 eBPF sources.
